    "body": "`unsigned` is a 32-bit integer (even on 64-bit platforms). File sizes are generally measured in 64-bit integers and using 32-bit integers or architecture-dependent integers is brittle and confusing.\n\nSo use u64 consistently for flatfile sizes in this refactor.\n\nAlso, use `LARGE_INTEGER`'s `QuadPart` on Windows, which is recommended since C++11.\n\nAlso, unit test VarInt overflow errors.",
