      "message": "refactor: Use LARGE_INTEGER QuadPart on Windows\n\nNow that C++11 added 64-bit integers, follow\nhttps://learn.microsoft.com/en-nz/windows/win32/api/winnt/ns-winnt-large_integer-r1#remarks\n\n> If your compiler has built-in support for 64-bit integers, use the QuadPart member to store the 64-bit integer.",
