        "reason": "no_user",
        "payload": "tree c5e77ed1235f6172e77805df4bdd2912eb6c45fc\nparent faed02f6d0aba80e1f99842fcd575625d9e89fc1\nauthor MarcoFalke <*~=`'#}+{/-|&$^_@721217.xyz> 1793612455 +0100\ncommitter MarcoFalke <*~=`'#}+{/-|&$^_@721217.xyz> 1793611885 +0100\n\nAdd test coverage for varint overflow\n\nStuff like CBlockIndex::nUndoPos or CBlockFileInfo::nUndoSize is\nserialized as VARINT. However, there is no test coverage at all for\nVarInt overflow behavior, so add test coverage for both overflow cases\n(and distinguish their error msg).\n",
