      "message": "Add test coverage for varint overflow\n\nStuff like CBlockIndex::nUndoPos or CBlockFileInfo::nUndoSize is\nserialized as VARINT. However, there is no test coverage at all for\nVarInt overflow behavior, so add test coverage for both overflow cases\n(and distinguish their error msg).",
